frontend
public/index.html — the single HTML shell React mounts into
src/assets/ — logos, food images, static media
components/Navbar.jsx — top nav bar (links, cart icon, logout)
components/FoodCard.jsx — displays one menu item with add-to-cart button
components/CartItem.jsx — displays one item inside the cart with qty controls
components/OrderStatusBadge.jsx — small colored badge showing order status (placed/preparing/ready)
components/ProtectedRoute.jsx — blocks a route unless logged in with the right role
pages/Login.jsx — student login form, validates college email regex
pages/Signup.jsx — student registration form
pages/Menu.jsx — browse food items, add to cart
pages/Cart.jsx — review cart before checkout
pages/Checkout.jsx — triggers Razorpay payment popup
pages/OrderHistory.jsx — student's past orders list
pages/OrderTracking.jsx — live status of current order (via socket)
pages/kitchen/KitchenLogin.jsx — kitchen staff login form
pages/kitchen/KitchenDashboard.jsx — live queue of incoming/paid orders for staff
pages/kitchen/OrderDetail.jsx — single order's full details + status update buttons
context/AuthContext.jsx — holds logged-in user + role across the app
context/CartContext.jsx — holds cart items across the app
hooks/useSocket.js — connects to Socket.IO and listens for real-time updates
services/api.js — configured Axios instance (base URL, headers)
services/authService.js — API calls for login/signup
services/orderService.js — API calls for placing/fetching orders
services/paymentService.js — API calls for Razorpay order creation/verification
utils/validators.js — the email regex + form validation helpers
App.jsx — sets up all routes/pages
main.jsx — React entry point, renders App.jsx into HTML
package.json — frontend dependencies + scripts

Backend

config/db.js — connects to MongoDB
config/razorpay.js — initializes Razorpay SDK with test keys
models/User.js — DB schema for users (student/kitchen, email, password, role)
models/MenuItem.js — DB schema for menu items (name, price, availability)
models/Order.js — DB schema for orders (items, student, status, total)
models/Payment.js — DB schema for payment records (Razorpay IDs, status)
controllers/authController.js — logic for login/signup/JWT issuing
controllers/menuController.js — logic for fetching/adding menu items
controllers/orderController.js — logic for placing orders, updating status
controllers/paymentController.js — creates Razorpay order, verifies payment signature
controllers/kitchenController.js — logic for kitchen dashboard (view/update orders)
routes/authRoutes.js — URL endpoints for login/signup
routes/menuRoutes.js — URL endpoints for menu CRUD
routes/orderRoutes.js — URL endpoints for placing/viewing orders
routes/paymentRoutes.js — URL endpoints for payment creation/verification
routes/kitchenRoutes.js — URL endpoints for kitchen-only actions
middleware/authMiddleware.js — verifies JWT on incoming requests
middleware/roleMiddleware.js — checks if user's role (student/kitchen) can access a route
middleware/errorHandler.js — catches and formats errors consistently
sockets/notificationSocket.js — Socket.IO setup, emits order-ready events
utils/emailValidator.js — server-side email regex check (source of truth)
utils/sendNotification.js — sends push/email/SMS notification
app.js — sets up Express app, middleware, routes
server.js — starts the server, connects DB + sockets
package.json — backend dependencies + scripts

Docs & root

docs/architecture.md — overall system design and data flow
docs/api-endpoints.md — list of all API routes and what they do
README.md — project overview, setup instructions
.gitignore — files/folders Git should ignore (node_modules, .env)
.env.example — template showing which environment variables are needed

